Package: codebookLLM
Title: PHI-Safe, LLM-Oriented Code Books for Data Frames
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Christopher", "Boyer", , "boyerc5@ccf.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates compact, machine-parseable code books that describe
    the structure of a data frame - names, classes, roles, missingness,
    cardinality, factor levels and the shape of numeric variables -
    without exposing row-level data. The output is designed to be pasted
    into a large language model prompt so that code can be written against
    a dataset that may contain protected health information.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
